      "text": "```\n   ~60%  of known human infectious diseases are ZOONOTIC in origin.\n   ~75%  of NEW / EMERGING human infectious diseases are zoonotic."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-ZOONOSES-AND-ONE-HEALTH.md#009",
      "path": [
        "04-ZOONOSES-AND-ONE-HEALTH.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
