        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Zoonoses and One Health - The Human-Animal-Environment Interface",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The list of pandemics and major outbreaks with animal origins is long: HIV (primates),\ninfluenza pandemics (birds/pigs), SARS (bats via civets), MERS (bats via camels), Ebola\n(bats/primates), and COVID-19 (coronavirus of probable bat origin). The pattern is the rule,\nnot the exception."
    },
