      "text": "## The Headline Zoonoses"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-ZOONOSES-AND-ONE-HEALTH.md#017",
      "path": [
        "04-ZOONOSES-AND-ONE-HEALTH.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
